  "limitations": [
    "Frozen synthetic author-labeled diagnostic corpus; not independent real-client production accuracy.",
    "Finished subset accuracy excludes pending jobs; full-plan recall is only a lower bound until processing drains.",
    "Exactly six fields, correct page, contiguous source quote and mandatory gold anchors are required for an exact match.",
    "Byte-identical originals count once across the combined demo organization; family-shared newsletter is reported separately.",
    "Preserved independent pre-inference decode artifact hashes are verified against original source/gold manifest. No gold is sent to ingestion or a model.",
    "Model call counts come from stored processor trace, not independent raw model transport recording. This measures combined source rules plus model pipeline, not LLM-only accuracy.",
    "Publication acceptance is separately measured, and expected review holds are not extraction failures. Notices must not prove cash settlement.",
    "This commit-safe summary contains whitelisted counts, source hashes and declared model identity only. Authentication records and raw private run artifacts are excluded.",
    "Encrypted original failures are reported separately; no claim is made that the reader unlocked their PDFs.",
    "On-disk source hashes identify files at export time; an already-running worker may have loaded an earlier build.",
    "An accepted relationship with undisclosed weight establishes qualitative exposure only. It does not establish a monetary or percentage allocation."
  ]
